       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TNUMBERS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS-400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS-400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT IN-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO DISK-READFILE
                  ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
                  ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  IN-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  IN-REC.
           05  FILE-START           PIC X(12).
           05  FILE-NUMS            PIC X(06).
           05  FILE-REST            PIC X(74).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  FILE-STAT                PIC XX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       BEGIN.
           OPEN I-O            IN-FILE.

       MAIN.
           READ IN-FILE AT END GO TO END-OF-JOB.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = ZEROS
               DISPLAY "READ IN-FILE ERROR: " FILE-STAT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           MOVE SPACES         TO FILE-NUMS.

           REWRITE IN-REC.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = ZEROS
               DISPLAY "READ IN-FILE ERROR: " FILE-STAT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           GO TO MAIN.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               IN-FILE.
           STOP RUN.

